# ## 8. Pattern note
#
# The 5 prior passes + 9-slice execution applied 4 kinds of fixes that
# left drift:
# 1. Function renames (P1-P4) left lsp_maneuver_* in lsp_diagnostics.oo
#    because the rename was scoped to a different file prefix.
# 2. Dead code deletion (X1-X4) left function definitions in scope but
#    no callers, when the renaming left the file's primary file name
#    unchanged (lsp_completion.oo was renamed to lsp_completion_kind_*
#    but the file was never revisited).
# 3. Academy header rewrites (D2) did not update the 4 type files
#    (lsp_types_*) because they were not the "doc drift" focus of that
#    pass.
# 4. Import management (D2) did not audit every import after the
#    renames; the renames left imports dangling in 14 places.
#
# The negative-trust 6th pass with import-usage cross-check + dead-file
# scan caught all 4 patterns. The system is now in its cleanest state
# across 6 deep-dive passes.
